\ A client of allocator.firth that reserves stock under the all-or-nothing policy.
\ It takes the host's decoded stock, IDs and quantities and supplies the
\ policy itself (true is all-or-nothing).
: reserve
  (forall ρ; ρ available:Int^many ids:Seq Int^many qs:Seq Int^many -- ρ code:Int^many remaining:Int^many allocated:Seq Int^many reasons:Seq Int^many)
  [ [ true ] dip ] dip allocate-batch;
